guidelines for running edge model in local machine: 

1. run the env using conda
2. install requirements 
    pip install -r requirements.txt
3. set environment: $env:EDGE_TTS_API_KEY="your_secret_key"
4. run server: uvicorn app:app --reload --port 8000



